Doctolib is looking for a Talent Acquisition Coordinator to join the Tech &amp; Product Talent Acquisition team in our Berlin office.&nbsp;

As a Coordinator, you'll focus on three essential areas: delivering exceptional candidate experience, mastering complex tech &amp; product interview scheduling, and continuously improving our interview processes. In this role, you'll gain comprehensive insight into recruitment while applying your organisational and project management skills in a fast-paced, high-volume environment and developing advanced people skills through multi-stakeholder management.&nbsp;

What you’ll do

As an intern, you will support us in the following areas:

• Coordinate interviews between candidates, Hiring Managers and tech interviewers, ensuring a smooth candidate experience.

• Send critical candidate communication during the recruitment process.&nbsp;

• Help maintain accurate candidate and interview information in our Applicant Tracking System.

• Manage complex interviewer pools, candidate information and interview supporting materials.

• Adapt and streamline the scheduling process to suit candidates and business needs.

• Contribute to interview process design, track scheduling metrics (time to schedule, time to interview) and own your own projects with a focus on process improvement while leveraging AI and automation tools.&nbsp;

• Collaborate with Talent Acquisition Partners and Hiring Managers on Tech &amp; Product recruitment end to end processes.

